<title>USA: AIG in life insurance venture in Egypt.</title>
<headline>AIG in life insurance venture in Egypt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>American International Group Inc said it received a license this quarter for a joint venture life company in Egypt, the first such license granted by the Egyptian government to an insurance company with a major foreign shareholding.</p>
<p>&quot;Egypt should be an excellent market for AIG in the coming years, and adds another link to our strong life insurance network in the Middle East,&quot; AIG chairman Maurice Greenberg said in a statement on first quarter earnings.</p>
<p>AIG also said it recently announced the formation of a new AIG joint venture life company in Peru.</p>
</text>
